{"title":"2007 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> be a triangle with incenter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> be a circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, of radius greater than that of the inscribed circle and that does not pass through any of the vertices. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e5e2212d37e0f988a4a149b3173f26b9cd2fc6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> be the point of intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> with the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2484f4fcf9c11699c809dc6fbf9a622e8347e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/395e1d255863e3a59f53defd30854ebc5afca5de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> the points of intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> with the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> being <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/4/a2484f4fcf9c11699c809dc6fbf9a622e8347e7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />; and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/1/51127609902e277dd5a87ed9f458b70148a37209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"24\" height=\"17\" /> the point of intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913e49ea63c6c130bb8d9d1c3556b052ecc404f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"14\" /> with the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> closest to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfb064112b6c94470339f6571f69d07afc1c024c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> be the point of intersection of the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bd4f31dd240f9abcfef58c968c264643b337d9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_1X_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/4/ba41b2cb54366d408375ef1584e027845d425d62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_3X_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" />. Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/0/370334b1a3582d54fad42c735dfdded7d216d3cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AK$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> intersects segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/c/66c99f4a06148118f5b0ffa45143a20e24887c78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X_2X_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"17\" /> at its midpoint.\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2007_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017110939\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 131/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3956/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.399      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    6.399      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26313:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017110939 and revision id 207456. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}